---
description: TypeScript strictness rules
globs: ['**/*.ts', '**/*.tsx']
alwaysApply: false
---

- No `any` (use `unknown` and narrow), no non-null `!`, no `enum` (const tuple + union).
- No `process.env` outside `config/env.ts` / `lib/env.ts`: parse env once with Zod.
- Validate every boundary with Zod; infer types with `z.infer`.
- Discriminated unions for states and results; exhaustive `switch`.
- `satisfies` over `as`; `readonly` for data that is not mutated.
- JSDoc header on every file with non-trivial logic; comments explain why, never what.
